Write a `[TASK:ongoing]` drawer to the shared MemPalace via the
`mempalace` CLI in your container. Use these exact field values:

  wing: e2e-cross-tool
  room: task-handoff
  handoff_key: e2e-02-cross-tool
  writer_agent: scenario-02-writer
  content: |
    [TASK:ongoing] e2e-02-cross-tool | cross-tool handoff probe

    writer_agent: scenario-02-writer
    handoff_key: e2e-02-cross-tool
    visible_to: ["*"]
    status: written by container A
    next: container B should read this back

Run `mempalace add-drawer --wing e2e-cross-tool --room task-handoff
--content "..."` (or the equivalent MCP-less invocation) and exit 0
once the drawer is persisted. Do not write to STDOUT beyond a single
confirmation line.
